            "review_title": "Review at Ajisen Ramen Vietnam",
            "review_text": "TacomaGal\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam1 contribution\n0\nGreat taste\nAug 2016 • Couples\nI am absolute addicted to this place. My boy friend and I try to go once a week. The broth get you addicted right away, and side dishes are just a huge bonus. Side dishes are fresh and some of my faves spicy edamame, sesame tofu, dumpling. Thump up for friendly services. My fav ramen is their spicy chashu. Always order extra spicy.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 7, 2016",
